window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>They say all gods can fall, but I will rise in the embers to save us all.</b></p> <p>Queen of the Dragons. The Chosen Wolf Princess. Lost…</p> <p>My name is Serendipity Fall and I'm trapped in a world I don't know how to escape. When the flames burn, I'm shown the way out, but at a price. I'm returning to my world as a goddess, and I can't control the power I've taken.</p> <p>My world is crumbling, my people need my help and I have to stop Awarn before he destroys my mates and then my world.</p> <p>There are few gods left in this world and I will be the last by the time I'm done with my hunt.</p> <p>Lost Embers <i>is a full-length reverse harem romance novel full of sexy alpha males, steamy scenes, a strong heroine, and a lot of sarcasm. Last book in the series. For mature listeners. Narrated in duet style.</i></p>"; 
